    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "CABLE ADDRESS.\nMANHOCO-MANILA\nALL TELEGRAPHIC CODES\nHUBERT C. ANDERSON\nMANAGER\nTHE SIGN OF SERVICE\nIN THE\nPHILIPPINES\nMANILA HOTEL\nManila, Philippines\nWirdreday\n8/30\n33\n* Juat a\nfew line.\nbifor I dark\ndoin\ntour.\nam\ngoing to one\nthis letter\nwith ore\nI wrote grate day don\nair mail in the hops\nthat it may busak\nир\nCà long zap beturn\nlettis - my maie sto\nyou wise bar ale.\ntwisted ny.\n→ now for",
      "some time breaun if\nur leair heis on the\n2nd that will be\nthe\nnext boat\nsachs on the 4th\n• but join when tos\nget to\nThan ghai\non mail\nмое\nEn prep of lapan,\nleaving hers\nI sad\non the 4th- to may\nas sure mail thi\nnow-\nQu my.\nlour\ndarlins - all gons wile - Bir\n0191210615"
    ],
